      <p>Higher Education Support Amendment (Freedom of Speech) Act 2021</p>
      <p>No. 22, 2021</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Higher Education Support Act 2003</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 22 March 2021</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
